# Single-page app: every unmatched path renders index.html.
#
# 200 rather than 301 so the client keeps the requested URL. Placed last so the
# real files above it -- /wasm, /models, /assets -- are served directly; without
# that ordering a missing WASM file would return HTML with a 200 and fail as an
# opaque decode error rather than a clean 404.
/*    /index.html   200
